Let's get to the company strategy as we have to have strong focus on the upcoming years. ;

The strategic theme for FY25 was [**Finding the sweet spot**](https://kontent-ai.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CENTRAL/pages/1190101032/FY25+Strategy+Finding+the+sweet+spot)**.** And we will continue on that so for the upcoming years, we want to [**Attract sweet spot clients**](https://kontent-ai.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CENTRAL/pages/1748762678/FY26+Strategy+Attract+sweet+spot+clients). ;

