## Mission and Vision ;

Mission and vision statements are critical to a **company's identity and strategy.** The mission statement defines what the company does and why, clarifying its core purpose for employees and stakeholders. In contrast, the vision statement outlines the company's future aspirations and long-term goals, motivating employees and aligning their efforts with its strategic objectives.

These statements serve as **guiding principles**, helping with strategic alignment, motivation, communication, differentiation, and a long-term focus. They establish a unique identity, foster a sense of purpose, and inspire a positive company culture, ultimately contributing to its long-term success by providing a clear path forward and a shared vision to work towards.

Please read through the Mission & Vision in [Confluence](https://kontent-ai.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CENTRAL/pages/10093541/Mission+and+Vision). Don't forget to **watch the recordings** as well! ;

