Please get familiar with the management team in advance, as you will have intro sessions with them in your onboarding agenda. There are two options for how to get familiar with the management team: via the [website](https://kontent.ai/about/#:~:text=Meet%20our%20Executive%20team) or directly in **Microsoft Teams**. ;

